msg-situa00-5 = 
    各类工匠公会在此$VarPhrase1变革。<br><if-1>he Hanseatic League $VarPhrase2 change in the government of $PlaceName.<br><endif><p>
    $NamedOneName，当地富格银行的领袖，$VarPhrase3市政府的变革。<br><endif><p>
